## This machine
<!-- Copy to ~/.claude/machine.md and edit. Never commit the copy; it holds machine and workplace facts. -->
- macOS: no `timeout` binary, never wrap commands in it. Android CLI at `<path to android CLI>` (`android-cli` skill); prefer it over raw `adb`/`emulator`.
  AVDs: `<phone-avd>` (default), `<tablet-avd>`, `<16kb-avd>`, `<min-sdk-avd>`.
- Guardrail hooks from the `guard-kit` plugin block protected-branch pushes and secret-file edits. A block is final, do not work around it.
- iOS: Xcode at `xcode-select -p`; default simulator `<iPhone simulator name>` (`xcrun simctl list devices available`).
- Ticket prefix for commit scopes: `<PREFIX>`. Default branch when a repo names none: `<develop | main>`.
